      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Research -> CI/CD:\n  PBO / Deflated Sharpe gate\n  (page 07) -- no model or\n  Committee-weight change\n  skips this.\n\nCI/CD -> Cloud:\n  Automated tests pass +\n  shadow-mode run for any\n  Committee/LLM change\n  (page 08).\n\nCloud -> VPS:\n  Manual operator approval\n  for anything touching live\n  order paths (execution-\n  safety skill pattern).\n\nVPS -> MT5:\n  ALLOW_TRADING gate,\n  paper by default.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Research -> CI/CD:\n  PBO / Deflated Sharpe gate\n  (page 07) -- no model or\n  Committee-weight change\n  skips this.\n\nCI/CD -> Cloud:\n  Automated tests pass +\n  shadow-mode run for any\n  Committee/LLM change\n  (page 08).\n\nCloud -> VPS:\n  Manual operator approval\n  for anything touching live\n  order paths (execution-\n  safety skill pattern).\n\nVPS -> MT5:\n  ALLOW_TRADING gate,\n  paper by default.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
